WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.903
Open Settings → API key

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.528
Click Generate API Key

00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:08.332
The full key is shown only once

00:00:08.332 --> 00:00:13.167
Copy it now and store it safely

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:15.766
Click Done to close the dialog

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:20.279
The page now shows the masked key and date

00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:26.099
To rotate, Regenerate revokes the old key at once
